further:
  - slug: antioch
    why: Pompey marched on Apamea from winter quarters probably at or near
      Antioch, and the 115 AD earthquake that wrecked both cities carries
      Antioch's name.
  - slug: alexander-the-great
    why: Pella was founded in the wars among Alexander's generals, and one older
      hypothesis credited the foundation to Alexander himself.
